      "_id": "ddba98962a6d468e",
      "name": "Obtenebration — 3 Advanced — Eyes of the Night",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>With the expenditure of a Mental Trait, you are able to see anything that goes on within the dark force created by any other use of this Discipline &mdash; you could evoke Eyes of the Night in another room and clairvoyantly scan the area within. You may also use this power to view your surroundings from any angle or vantage point within 50 feet of your body where a shadow exists. You only perceive visual information through use of this power, and using it requires the expenditure of a Mental Trait per five minutes of use.</p>",
        "source": "Laws of Elysium, Disciplines",
        "discipline": "Obtenebration",
        "level": "advanced",
